Site keyboard shortcuts

M — Toggle site mute
G — Toggle magnifier in a media viewer
L — Toggle light/dark mode
S — Reverse the copyright marquee direction
1 — Lower volume by one level
2 — Raise volume by one level
= — Increase idle model speed, up to 5x (3D assets only)
- — Decrease idle model speed, down to 1/5x (3D assets only)
0 — Reset idle model speed to 1x (3D assets only)
